00:07:37,551 --> 00:07:40,142
祈祷你说的话 不是错别字
Praying that wasn't an auto-correct.

169
00:07:41,940 --> 00:07:43,880
看看这些我练习画的鸭
Look at all the practice ducks I've drawn.

170
00:07:44,120 --> 00:07:45,160
美国木鸭
The American Wood duck.

171
00:07:45,640 --> 00:07:46,674
丑鸭
The Harlequin duck.

172
00:07:46,674 --> 00:07:48,601
斑嘴鸭
The Spot-Billed duck.

173
00:07:49,220 --> 00:07:49,580
绿头鸭
A mallard.

174
00:07:50,640 --> 00:07:51,120
绿头鸭
A mallard.

175
00:07:52,000 --> 00:07:54,160
绿头鸭 绿头鸭
A mallard, a mallard--

176
00:07:54,220 --> 00:07:56,780
卡洛琳 把他的电池拔出来
Caroline, take is batteries out.

177
00:07:57,820 --> 00:08:00,260
这只美鸭将会为我赢得大赛
This beauty's gonna win me the stamp contest.

178
00:08:00,540 --> 00:08:02,720
万事俱备 只差上色了
All I have to do now is color it.

179
00:08:02,720 --> 00:08:05,940
然后好好休息 计划我的庆功派对
And then sit back and plan my victory party.

180
00:08:07,000 --> 00:08:09,080
你猜我会用什么邮票来邮寄邀请函
Guess which stamp I'll use to send the invites?

181
00:08:09,520 --> 00:08:10,180
基佬彩虹旗邮票吗
Gay flag?

182
00:08:10,980 --> 00:08:12,320
不 是绿头鸭邮票
No, a mallard!

183
00:08:14,700 --> 00:08:16,720
你从哪弄来的可可粉啊
Where'd you get that cacao from?

184
00:08:17,160 --> 00:08:19,620
克林特收工回家之前留了几克给我
Clint gave me a couple grams before he left last night.

185
00:08:19,900 --> 00:08:22,300
我一整天都微剂量在服用
I've been micro-dosing it all day.

186
00:08:35,660 --> 00:08:38,440
你为什么要直接抹牙龈上啊
Why are you rubbing it on your gums?

187
00:08:38,560 --> 00:08:39,520
长牙嘴痒吗
Are you teething?

188
00:08:41,020 --> 00:08:43,640
克林特说直接吸收爽度更强
Clint says the buzz is stronger if I take it straight.

189
00:08:45,140 --> 00:08:48,580
我本来还不相信克林特说的可可粉会上瘾
Okay, I didn't believe Clint when he said cacao was addictive,

190
00:08:48,580 --> 00:08:50,760
但我本来也不相信爱尔兰矮妖是真的
but I also didn't believe in leprechauns

191
00:08:50,760 --> 00:08:52,440
但在矮妖店里做事后我就信了
until I started working for one.

192
00:08:54,740 --> 00:08:55,960
如果我把牙龈割开
If I cut my gums...

193
00:08:58,600 --> 00:09:00,960
粉会不会更快进入我的血管啊
Will it enter my bloodstream any faster?

194
00:09:01,120 --> 00:09:02,160
老毒虫你应该懂啊
You're a junkie!

195
00:09:03,280 --> 00:09:05,940
阿憨 你又跟上次喝完整瓶红牛一样嗨了
Han, you're acting like that time you had a whole Red Bull.

196
00:09:07,060 --> 00:09:07,660
好了
Okay...

197
00:09:08,680 --> 00:09:10,740
你上瘾了
you have a problem!

198
00:09:11,340 --> 00:09:13,140
我会告诉克林特不许再供应你
I'm telling Clint you're cut off.

199
00:09:13,920 --> 00:09:15,760
那我要告诉克林特我爱他
Well, I'm telling Clint I love him.

200
00:09:15,800 --> 00:09:16,620
他就爱听这个
He loves that.

201
00:09:17,860 --> 00:09:20,580
行 我只好不靠可可粉完成我的邮票了
Fine, I'll just finish my stamp without cacao.

202
00:09:21,796 --> 00:09:23,188
去你的
Damn it!

203
00:09:26,023 --> 00:09:27,477
大家安安
Hi, everybody!

204
00:09:32,920 --> 00:09:35,120
我希望他们永远都不指望
I hope they're never expecting Barbara

205
00:09:35,120 --> 00:09:36,560
芭芭拉开始有任何短期记忆
to have a short-term memory.

206
00:09:38,800 --> 00:09:40,900
别看了 别看我了
Oh, look away, look away.

207
00:09:42,320 --> 00:09:44,320
情况越来越糟糕了
Things have gotten real bad.

208
00:09:45,600 --> 00:09:48,060
我现在看起来像你们这帮人了
I look like all of you now.

209
00:09:49,840 --> 00:09:52,820
苏菲 你为什么不跟我们一起去做指甲
Sophie, why didn't you come with us to the nail place?

210
00:09:52,900 --> 00:09:54,260
可好玩了
It was so much fun.

211
00:09:55,220 --> 00:09:57,200
我去不了 太忙了
I couldn't make it, I was too busy

212
00:09:57,200 --> 00:09:59,160
忙着给芭芭拉的尿布贴亮片
bedazzling Barbara's diapers.

213
00:10:00,560 --> 00:10:02,660
我只能接受这个事实了
I'm just gonna have to face it--

214
00:10:02,660 --> 00:10:06,880
我至少有12年的时间不能再美艳动人了
I'm not gonna be pretty again for at least 12 years.

215
00:10:07,660 --> 00:10:10,580
天啊 到时候我就到了卡洛琳的岁数了
Oh, I'll be Caroline's age by then.

216
00:10:12,780 --> 00:10:16,377
苏菲 我总是告诉你 你在我眼里永远性感
Sophie, I keep saying, you'll always be sexy to me.

217
00:10:16,377 --> 00:10:18,780
我不想说些情意绵绵的肉麻情话
And I hate to sound all lovey-dovey,

218
00:10:18,780 --> 00:10:20,840
但我的鸡因你而勃
but you're giving me a boner.

219
00:10:22,240 --> 00:10:24,920
你是因为没得选才这么说
You're just saying that 'cause you have to.

220
00:10:25,600 --> 00:10:28,160
我才不要你的可怜勃
I don't want your pity boner.

221
00:10:31,780 --> 00:10:34,360
卡洛琳 如果真有可怜勃这回事
Caroline, if pity boners are a thing,

222
00:10:34,360 --> 00:10:36,460
那你得赶紧重出江湖啊
you have got to get back out there.

223
00:10:38,420 --> 00:10:40,540
我刚才也在想同一件事
I was thinking the same thing.

224
00:10:44,800 --> 00:10:45,880
克林特 你带货来了吗
You got the stuff, Clint?

225
00:10:46,400 --> 00:10:48,180
是顶级货吧
It's premium grade, right?

226
00:10:48,600 --> 00:10:51,120
如果不是 那你就准备接受
If it isn't, you're in for a very

227
00:10:51,120 --> 00:10:52,740
一场不太愉快的交谈了
unpleasant conversation.

228
00:10:53,840 --> 00:10:56,780
我哥伦比亚的供货商跟我保证过
My guy from Columbia guarantees it.

229
00:10:57,860 --> 00:10:59,520
不是那个毒品大国 是我哥伦比亚大学的同学
Not the country, we went to college together.

230
00:11:00,440 --> 00:11:01,620
想验个货吗
Want a little taste?

231
00:11:01,840 --> 00:11:03,640
废话 还用你说
You bet your butt I do!

232
00:11:03,820 --> 00:11:06,160
我想确定里面没有掺杂便宜雀巢咖啡粉
I want to make sure it's not cut with Nestle Quik.

233
00:11:11,360 --> 00:11:14,520
脏驴鸡尾酒就是用这种货调的
That's the stuff muddy donkeys are made of.

234
00:11:17,240 --> 00:11:17,880
麦克斯
Max!

235
00:11:17,880 --> 00:11:19,760
没想到在这遇见你
Uh, fancy meeting you here.

236
00:11:20,700 --> 00:11:23,480
我和克林特在叙兄弟情呢 聊聊...
Clint and I were just bro-ing out over...

237
00:11:23,480 --> 00:11:24,100
运动啊
sports.

238
00:11:25,040 --> 00:11:26,080
大胸啊
And breasts.

239
00:11:26,340 --> 00:11:28,400
还有...动物园啊
And...zoos?

240
00:11:29,460 --> 00:11:30,780
男人平时见面都聊什么呀
What do men talk about?

241
00:11:31,820 --> 00:11:32,460
麦克斯
Hey, Max.

242
00:11:32,960 --> 00:11:34,520
昨晚我们赚翻了 对吧
We killed it last night, huh?

243
00:11:34,540 --> 00:11:35,400
我的功劳大过你哦
Me more than you.

244
00:11:36,180 --> 00:11:38,440
你到底要不要 我得去做我的播客了
You gonna want this or not, I got to go do my podcast.

245
00:11:39,000 --> 00:11:39,980
我要采访我自己
I'm interviewing myself.

246
00:11:41,580 --> 00:11:44,080
是不是毒品交易 我一看就能看出来
I know a drug deal when I see it!

247
00:11:44,280 --> 00:11:45,360
他不许碰毒
He's cut off.

248
00:11:45,440 --> 00:11:47,400
就像2元酒之夜 我不许碰酒一样
Like me on $2 margarita night.

249
00:11:48,060 --> 00:11:50,860
麦克斯 我需要可可粉来完成我的鸭子邮票
Max, I need that cacao to finish my duck stamp!

250
00:11:51,420 --> 00:11:53,900
让这匹巧克力小马再带我飞最后一次吧
One last ride on the chocolate pony.

251
00:11:54,640 --> 00:11:57,100
瞧瞧你 满脸都是巧克力
Look at you-- chocolate all over your face.

252
00:11:57,460 --> 00:12:00,040
你就像《军火贩》的肥男主在看影评 爽得咧
You look like Jonah Hill reading the reviews for War Dogs.

253
00:12:01,200 --> 00:12:03,340
克林特 你不许卖给他
Clint, don't you dare sell it to him.

254
00:12:03,840 --> 00:12:05,860
轮不到你告诉我该怎么做
You can't tell me what to do, okay?

255
00:12:05,900 --> 00:12:07,560
我是说真的 我会辞职的哦
I'm serious--I will quit.

256
00:12:08,740 --> 00:12:10,900
那把我对我妈说的同一句话送给你
Oh, hmm, I'll say the same thing I said to my mother--

257
00:12:12,180 --> 00:12:13,180
接受请辞
resignation accepted.

258
00:12:14,520 --> 00:12:16,860
你犯了一个天大的错误
You just made a huge mistake.

259
00:12:18,500 --> 00:12:19,900
不用你说我也知道
You're talking to someone

260
00:12:19,900 --> 00:12:22,639
我可是看了《真探》第二季的人
who watched the second season of True Detective.

261
00:12:22,639 --> 00:12:24,889
你说是吧 阿憨
Right, Han?

262
00:12:27,640 --> 00:12:30,080
那个人渣不可能把全部可可粉都带走吧
That scumbag couldn't have taken all the cacao.

263
00:12:30,800 --> 00:12:32,380
快 帮我找找酒柜有没有
Quick, help me check the cabinets.

264
00:12:33,060 --> 00:12:34,120
别碰我的抽屉[内裤] 阿憨
Keep away from my drawers, Han.

265
00:12:35,360 --> 00:12:36,500
这句话你肯定整天听到
You got to be used to hearing that.

266
00:12:38,820 --> 00:12:41,840
麦克斯 我刚跟免费诊所告别了
Max, I just gave a good-bye speech at the free clinic.

267
00:12:42,260 --> 00:12:44,120
对了 那个实验室技术员
Oh, also, the lab technician

268
00:12:44,120 --> 00:12:46,520
让你尽快打给她
said for you to call her ASAP.

269
00:12:47,340 --> 00:12:49,800
克莱尔什么事都爱大惊小怪
Ugh, Claire freaks out about everything.

270
00:12:50,780 --> 00:12:52,900
我要把这地方翻个底朝天
I'll tear this place apart!

271
00:12:53,360 --> 00:12:54,520
可可粉到底在哪里
Where the hell is the cacao?

272
00:12:55,460 --> 00:12:56,820
发生什么事了 克林特去哪儿了
What's happening, where's Clint?

273
00:12:57,180 --> 00:12:58,680
-他辞职了 -他辞职了
- He quit. - He quit?

274
00:12:58,940 --> 00:13:00,220
但他的追随者怎么办
But what about his following?

275
00:13:00,420 --> 00:13:01,640
我们的追随者怎么办
What about our following?

276
00:13:01,760 --> 00:13:03,160
我的告别巡回秀怎么办
What about my good-bye tour?

277
00:13:03,400 --> 00:13:04,180
跟你的告别秀告别啊
Say good-bye to it.

278
00:13:06,240 --> 00:13:07,440
我好像找到了点
I think I found some!

279
00:13:09,860 --> 00:13:11,980
不是 那是纯灰尘
Nope, that was straight-up dirt.

280
00:13:13,098 --> 00:13:14,069
这样最好
It's for the best.

281
00:13:14,620 --> 00:13:16,980
因为那位可可粉小姐已经走火入魔了
'Cause Jane Cacaoski over there can't get enough.

282
00:13:17,500 --> 00:13:18,960
我回吧台后面[监狱]工作了
I'll just get back behind the bar.

283
00:13:19,120 --> 00:13:22,620
抱歉先失陪啦 其中一间牢房的犯人跑出来了
Now, if you'll excuse me, one of my hotels came loose

284
00:13:22,620 --> 00:13:23,980
都怪我当时忙着对人竖中指没看好
while I was giving someone the finger.

285
00:13:24,960 --> 00:13:27,220
我想我只能打给广告分类网上
I guess I'm going to have to call that other dealer

286
00:13:27,220 --> 00:13:28,576
另一位粉贩子了
I found on Craigslist.

287
00:13:28,576 --> 00:13:31,788
我是老鼠 我要我的大米
I'm Ice-T and I need my Coco.

288
00:13:32,220 --> 00:13:33,500
阿憨 如果你能拿到可可粉
Han, if you can get that cacao,

289
00:13:33,960 --> 00:13:36,240
麦克斯自己也能做可可风暴
Max can make the Cacao Storms herself.

290
00:13:36,540 --> 00:13:39,480
我见过她用罂粟籽面包圈和气泡水做出鸦片
I've seen her make opium out of poppy seed bagels and a Lacroix.

291
00:13:40,280 --> 00:13:41,040
阿憨 快打给粉贩子
Han, call that dealer.

292
00:13:41,420 --> 00:13:42,560
已经拨出去了
Already dialing.

293
00:13:42,560 --> 00:13:45,037
我已经在去"后庭"的半路上了
I'm halfway down the Hershey Highway.

294
00:13:45,037 --> 00:13:48,372
我是说软糖工厂
I meant the Fudge Factory.

295
00:13:48,860 --> 00:13:50,260
我不想知道你的私生活
I don't want to hear about your personal life,

296
00:13:50,260 --> 00:13:51,140
快打电话吧
just call the dealer.

297
00:13:56,060 --> 00:13:57,200
阿憨 那家伙在哪儿
Han, where is this guy?

298
00:13:57,260 --> 00:13:58,240
我好害怕啊
I'm scared.

299
00:13:58,620 --> 00:14:00,080
别人可能会误会我们是情侣
Someone might think we're a couple.

300
00:14:00,980 --> 00:14:02,440
我也想他马上来啊
I hope he gets here soon.

301
00:14:02,660 --> 00:14:04,820
我刚吸食了一品脱的冰淇淋
I just snorted a pint of Chunky Monkey.

302
00:14:06,760 --> 00:14:08,720
他来了 淡定点
That's him, now act cool.

303
00:14:10,120 --> 00:14:10,980
毒贩子先生 你好呀
Yoo-hoo, Mr. Drug Dealer!

304
00:14:11,080 --> 00:14:11,900
这边
Right here.

305
00:14:12,820 --> 00:14:14,420
你真让我丢脸
You're embarrassing me!

306
00:14:14,780 --> 00:14:16,380
对了 记得告诉他我们不是情侣
Oh, also, tell him we're not a couple.

307
00:14:17,260 --> 00:14:18,420
你们俩是来买可可粉的吗
You guys here for the cacao?

308
00:14:18,640 --> 00:14:20,740
废话少说 货在哪儿
Let's cut to the chase, where's the dope?

309
00:14:21,160 --> 00:14:22,400
我面前就有一蠢货
Standing right in front of me.

310
00:14:22,580 --> 00:14:23,400
我们不是情侣哦
We're not together.

311
00:14:24,520 --> 00:14:25,700
你们想让警察听见吗
You want the cops to hear us?

312
00:14:26,360 --> 00:14:28,180
有关系吗 你是在卖巧克力粉
Would it matter? You're selling chocolate.

313
00:14:28,900 --> 00:14:31,480
我知道 但假装违法感觉更好玩啊
I know, but it's more fun to act like it's naughty.

314
00:14:32,020 --> 00:14:32,980
这是我干这行的唯一原因
That's the only reason I do this.

315
00:14:33,240 --> 00:14:34,060
我无聊死了
I'm so bored.

316
00:14:34,380 --> 00:14:35,640
我是一名全职爷爷
I'm a stay-at-home grandpa.

317
00:14:36,080 --> 00:14:37,140
给我看街粉
Show me the skrank!

318
00:14:38,080 --> 00:14:40,000
这是我为街头可可粉专门编造的一个词
That's the word I made up for street cacao.

319
00:14:40,900 --> 00:14:42,240
在这
Here it is.

320
00:14:42,560 --> 00:14:44,000
为了得到它 我还杀了一名妓女
Had to kill a hooker to get it.

321
00:14:44,780 --> 00:14:45,860
瞎说的啦
I wish.

322
00:14:47,740 --> 00:14:49,440
我的儿媳妇在雀巢工作
My daughter-in-law works for Nestle.

323
00:14:52,360 --> 00:14:53,880
厄尔 你在这里干嘛
Earl, what're you doing out here?

324
00:14:54,140 --> 00:14:55,980
先把话说清楚 我跟阿憨在这里
Just to be clear, I'm out here with Han

325
00:14:55,980 --> 00:14:58,480
纯粹是公事 绝对没私情
for business, nothing romantic.

326
00:14:58,980 --> 00:15:00,440
你们在外面私会
What are you doing out here

327
00:15:00,440 --> 00:15:02,920
我的加拿大伟哥供货商干嘛
with my Canadian Viagra connection?

328
00:15:04,200 --> 00:15:06,440
-厄尔 -比尔
- Hey, Earl! - Hey, Bill!

329
00:15:06,940 --> 00:15:08,380
伙计 你的儿媳妇还好吗
Hey, man, how's your daughter-in-law?

330
00:15:08,679 --> 00:15:12,440
还在多伦多的雀巢公司想着往上爬吗
Still climbing the corporate ladder at Nestle Toronto?

331
00:15:12,440 --> 00:15:14,120
然后周末健健身
And doing CrossFit on the weekends.

332
00:15:14,600 --> 00:15:16,240
泰德终于拿到真正的房产证了
And Ted's finally got his real estate license.

333
00:15:17,060 --> 00:15:18,720
没人想听 老爷爷
No one cares, Grandpa!

334
00:15:19,300 --> 00:15:21,360
你去跟公园里的鸽子唠家常吧
Tell that to the pigeons in the park!

335
00:15:21,360 --> 00:15:25,040
老子都快要把巧克力糖注射进静脉了
I'm this close to main-lining Tootsie Rolls.

336
00:15:25,040 --> 00:15:27,260
-给你钱 -不是吧
- Here's the money. - Not this again!

337
00:15:28,260 --> 00:15:30,220
我就出来想抽支大麻烟
I come out here to smoke a joint,

338
00:15:30,220 --> 00:15:31,800
就这么让我撞见毒品交易吗
and I walk in on a drug deal?

339
00:15:32,460 --> 00:15:32,980
可耻
